	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 103系は1964年に量産車が登場した国鉄の通勤形車両。駅間距離の短い路線環境や経済性を考慮して設計された。■オレンジバーミリオンの塗装色の車両は中央線、青梅線、五日市線、大阪環状線、桜島線、片町線等で運行された。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The 103 series is a Japanese National Railways commuter train that was mass-produced in 1964. It was designed taking into consideration the route environment with short distances between stations and economic efficiency. ■Vehicles painted orange vermilion were operated on the Chuo Line, Ome Line, Goichi Line, Osaka Loop Line, Sakurajima Line, Katamachi Line, etc."
		]
	},
